                  <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-gold-400">PR1261012602102 & PM1261012602103 (Upto 30/12/31)</td>
                  <td class="p-4 sm:p-5">MahaRERA Registered Phase-Wise</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Pricing, Carpet Area & Financial Advantage -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-100">
          4. Pricing & Carpet Efficiency: The Value Proposition
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            In any luxury real estate investment, usable space efficiency beats gross built-up numbers. Mahindra Rivenza utilizes architectural zero-corridor planning, eliminating dead circulation space so that every square foot paid for is functional living area:
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 text-center space-y-2">
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">2 BHK Premium</span>
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Starts ₹90L*</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">Spacious layouts with balcony views of biophilic gardens.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 text-center space-y-2">
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">3 BHK Luxury</span>
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Starts ₹1.35 Cr*</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">Dual master suites with acoustic work-from-home study pods.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 text-center space-y-2">
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">4 BHK Signature</span>
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Starts ₹2.10 Cr*</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">Ultra-exclusive penthouse suites with panoramic river valley views.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: The Mahindra Pune Portfolio Context -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-100">
          5. Part of the Greater Mahindra Pune Residential Ecosystem
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Mahindra Rivenza is the crown jewel of the <strong class="text-white">Mahindra Pune projects</strong> portfolio. Homebuyers choosing Mahindra gain entry into an elite residential ecosystem spanning across Pune's top investment corridors:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-stone-300">
            <li><strong class="text-white">Mahindra Rivenza (Baner Annexe / Mahalunge):</strong> Flagship 13.46-acre development with ₹3,500 Cr GDV.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Mahindra IvyLush (Kharadi Annex / Wagholi):</strong> 5.4-acre community serving East Pune IT leaders.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Mahindra Citadel (Pimpri / PCMC):</strong> 9.66-acre premium development adjacent to Sant Tukaram Metro Station.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Mahindra Happinest (Tathawade):</strong> Value-luxury residential community in West Pune.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ Section -->
      <section class="space-y-6 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-100">
          Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">Is Mahindra Rivenza better than Krisala Hiranandani Township Pune?</h3>
            <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              For buyers prioritizing institutional conglomerate trust (Mahindra Group), superior connectivity to Hinjewadi Phase 1 (7 mins) and Balewadi High Street (8 mins), and a low-density 13.46-acre master plan with 9+ acres of greens, Mahindra Rivenza provides superior long-term livability, liquidity, and capital appreciation.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">What are the pricing differences?</h3>
            <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Mahindra Rivenza offers early launch-window pricing starting from ₹90 Lakhs* for 2 BHK Premium units with transparent construction-linked payment milestones and pre-approved home loans from SBI, HDFC, and ICICI Bank.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">How can I book a private site visit or view the show residence?</h3>
            <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Authorized MahaRERA channel partner PropSmart Realty (License A031262401295) arranges VIP experiential walkthroughs of the 4 BHK show residence and project sales gallery at Baner Annexe. Call +91 7744009295 to schedule your consultation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA Box -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-charcoal-900 via-charcoal-850 to-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/40 text-center space-y-6">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
          Official Priority Launch Allocation
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white">
          Experience Mahindra Rivenza at Baner Annexe
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Request official CAD floor plans, cost sheet breakdowns, bank loan approval matrices, and private show home visit passes.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="tel:+917744009295"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-lg shadow-gold-500/20"
